port/ga#hasElementalTypes>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"True when every move in this game has an elemental type.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hasElementalTypes>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hasElementalTypes>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#wholeNumbersOnly>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#wholeNumbersOnly>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#moveName>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"What a creature's attack is called.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#moveName>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hitPoints>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"A creature's own health, in the source game's hit points.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hitPoints>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#bonusHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Health granted above the maxi